{"id": "dev068", "question": "上游偶发失败，怎样让后续用备用文案照跑，文案类型有何要求？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/build/predefined-error-handling-logic"], "nuggets": [{"text": "选择默认值模式可在节点失败时用备用值继续运行。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "备用值必须与节点输出类型相同。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "distant", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "synonym", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/build/predefined-error-handling-logic"]], "reference_answer": "将节点错误处理设为“默认值”，失败时以备用值替代后继续运行；备用文案类型必须与该节点输出类型相同。", "most_likely_failure": "把备用文案类型当作任意字符串，或把重试/失败分支误当默认值续跑。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/build/predefined-error-handling-logic"]}
{"id": "dev069", "question": "范例待审时能撤回吗，递交前插件来源和试跑环境有何要求？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/publish/publish-to-marketplace"], "nuggets": [{"text": "Pending状态的模板可撤回为Draft后修改并重新提交。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "提交前应用使用的所有插件须直接从市场安装。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "提交前应在最新Community Edition上至少运行一次应用。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "distant", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "synonym", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/publish/publish-to-marketplace"]], "reference_answer": "Pending状态可撤回到Draft，修改后重新提交。插件须直接从Dify市场安装；应用须在最新Community Edition上至少运行一次，以此核验兼容性。", "most_likely_failure": "把Pending误认为不可撤回，或漏掉市场安装插件及最新版Community Edition实跑要求。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/publish/publish-to-marketplace"]}
{"id": "dev070", "question": "给Skill Builder的单条消息附文件，数量及图片、其他文件的大小上限各是多少？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/build/skills"], "nuggets": [{"text": "Skill Builder每条消息最多附加10个文件。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "Skill Builder消息附件中图片每个不超过10 MB。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "Skill Builder消息附件中其他文件每个不超过15 MB。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "numeric_table", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/build/skills"]], "reference_answer": "每条消息最多附10个文件；图片每个不超过10 MB，其他文件每个不超过15 MB。这些只给Builder提供上下文，不自动进入Skill文件树。", "most_likely_failure": "把Skill导入包的50MB限额套给Builder消息附件，混淆附件数与单文件大小。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/build/skills"]}
{"id": "dev071", "question": "上传文件给外部存储该选哪种正文，非文本响应会变成什么变量？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/http-request"], "nuggets": [{"text": "上传文件变量使用二进制请求正文。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "二进制响应内容成为文件变量。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "numeric_table", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/http-request"]], "reference_answer": "发送前序文件变量时选“二进制”请求正文；返回的二进制等非文本内容会成为文件变量，供后续节点使用。", "most_likely_failure": "把上传正文选成JSON或表单，或将非文本响应当作普通字符串变量。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/http-request"]}
{"id": "dev072", "question": "思考混进答复时，哪些模型能分离？界面和API各怎么开，关掉后思考输出怎样？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/llm"], "nuggets": [{"text": "界面通过启用推理标签分离开关分离思考与回答。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "API开启分离时设置reasoning_format为separated。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "关闭分离开关时reasoning_content为空。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "分离设置仅适用于用think标签包裹推理内容的模型。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "neighbor", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/llm"]], "reference_answer": "仅对用think标签包裹思考的模型生效。界面打开“启用推理标签分离”，API设reasoning_format=separated；打开后text保留回答、reasoning_content接收思考，关闭时reasoning_content为空。", "most_likely_failure": "把分离功能推广到所有推理模型，或漏掉API的separated值及关闭时空输出。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/llm"]}
{"id": "dev073", "question": "每轮沿用上一稿再润色，该用什么节点？没设退出条件会何时停？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/loop"], "nuggets": [{"text": "依赖上一轮结果继续处理应使用循环节点。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "未指定终止条件时，循环持续到最大循环次数。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "neighbor", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/loop"]], "reference_answer": "用循环节点，因为每轮依赖前一轮结果；不设终止条件时会持续到达到最大循环次数。", "most_likely_failure": "把前后依赖的反复润色当作独立迭代，或误称无退出条件会永远执行。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/loop"]}
{"id": "dev074", "question": "在哪查哪步最慢和单步最近的入出参？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact_single", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/debug/history-and-logs"], "nuggets": [{"text": "应用运行历史的追踪展示各节点耗时。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "节点配置面板的最后运行展示最近输入、输出和时间。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "short", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/debug/history-and-logs"]], "reference_answer": "在应用运行历史的“追踪”查看每个节点耗时；单节点配置面板点“最后运行”，查看该节点最近输入、输出和时间详情。", "most_likely_failure": "只给总耗时，遗漏节点追踪入口或把最后运行当作完整运行历史。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/debug/history-and-logs"]}
{"id": "dev075", "question": "云端Sandbox能发布流水线模板吗？换到支持的套餐发布后，在哪找到模板？", "split": "dev", "type": "version", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "cloud", "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/knowledge-pipeline/publish-knowledge-pipeline"], "nuggets": [{"text": "云端Sandbox不能将流水线发布为可复用模板。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "发布为流水线后，模板出现在自定义模板中。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "single_version", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/knowledge-pipeline/publish-knowledge-pipeline"]], "reference_answer": "Sandbox不能发布为可复用流水线模板，该功能限Professional和Team；在允许的套餐中发布为流水线后，模板出现在“自定义模板”中。", "most_likely_failure": "忽略Sandbox套餐限制，或把自定义模板入口与公共市场混为一谈。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/knowledge-pipeline/publish-knowledge-pipeline"]}
{"id": "dev076", "question": "从市场给云端装集成却跳到别处，怎样改回？谁能调整安装权限？", "split": "dev", "type": "version", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "cloud", "expected_route": "SINGLE", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/plugins"], "nuggets": [{"text": "市场安装目标误指别处时，清除安装偏好设置中保存的URL以恢复安装到Dify Cloud。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "工作空间所有者和管理员可以在集成页面底部的权限中设置安装权限。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "single", "behavior_subtype": "single_version", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/workspace/plugins"]], "reference_answer": "清除“安装偏好设置”中保存的URL，即可重新安装到Dify Cloud。工作空间所有者和管理员可以在“集成”页面底部的“权限”中调整谁能安装和调试集成。", "most_likely_failure": "把自部署填入部署URL的步骤套给Cloud，或把权限设置者误判为普通成员。"}
{"id": "dev077", "question": "CodeExecutionError通常指什么依赖出了问题？沿该依赖，运行隔离方式和调整超时的配置模板分别是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/debug/error-type", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/code"], "nuggets": [{"text": "CodeExecutionError表示沙箱无法执行代码，通常意味着服务停止。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "沙箱以独立容器运行，将执行与宿主机及其他服务隔离。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "沙箱worker超时等行为通过docker/envs/core-services/sandbox.env.example中的SANDBOX_*变量调整。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "chain", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/debug/error-type"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/code"]], "reference_answer": "该错误表示沙箱无法执行代码，通常是服务停止。沙箱以独立容器运行，隔离宿主机和其他服务；其行为（含worker超时）通过docker/envs/core-services/sandbox.env.example中的SANDBOX_*变量调整。", "most_likely_failure": "把沙箱服务无法执行误判成用户代码异常，或误改API输出限制模板而不是沙箱行为模板。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/debug/error-type", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/code"]}
{"id": "dev078", "question": "每条消息都要启动处理，该选哪种应用和收尾环节？沿该环节，怎样填入上游值，并在后台仍忙时先发确认？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/build/workflow-chatflow", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/answer"], "nuggets": [{"text": "Chatflow中每条用户消息都会触发设计的流程。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "Chatflow必需使用直接回复节点作为结束节点。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "直接回复节点用{{variable_name}}语法引用上游节点变量。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "直接回复节点的渐进式响应能在后台继续处理时先发送确认。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "chain", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/build/workflow-chatflow"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/answer"]], "reference_answer": "选择Chatflow，每条消息会触发流程；它必需直接回复节点收尾。该节点用{{variable_name}}引用上游值，可用渐进式响应在后台继续处理时先发送确认。", "most_likely_failure": "直接给Workflow的输出节点，或以为必须等后台处理完成才能发出阶段确认。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/build/workflow-chatflow", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/answer"]}
{"id": "dev079", "question": "Dify第9课的固定排版环节放在哪，正文取谁的值？该环节怎样读嵌套姓名并兜底缺失项？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "self_host", "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-09", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/template"], "nuggets": [{"text": "第9课的模板转换节点放在Agent之后、输出之前。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "模板body变量接Agent的text输出。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "该环节用点号或括号访问嵌套对象或数组元素。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "该环节用default过滤器给缺失字段提供默认值。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "chain", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-09"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/template"]], "reference_answer": "在Agent之后、输出节点之前插入模板转换节点，其body变量接Agent的text输出。该环节可用点号或括号读取嵌套对象或数组，例如{{user.name}}；缺失字段可用default过滤器提供默认值，例如{{user.name | default(\"there\")}}。", "most_likely_failure": "取错Agent正文输出，或把嵌套字段访问与default兜底当作同一语法。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["learn/tutorials/workflow-101/lesson-09", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/template"]}
