{"id": "dev081", "question": "Langfuse接入缺地址和公开标识，分别填哪项？LangSmith鉴权选哪类，项目名不匹配会怎样？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langfuse", "cloud/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langsmith"], "nuggets": [{"text": "Langfuse需要填写Host。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "Langfuse需要填写Public Key。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "LangSmith凭据类型选择Personal Access Token。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "LangSmith配置的项目名不一致会自动创建新项目。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "parallel_compare", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langfuse", "self-host/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langfuse"], ["cloud/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langsmith", "self-host/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langsmith"]], "reference_answer": "Langfuse还需Host和Public Key；LangSmith凭据选择Personal Access Token。LangSmith配置的项目名与已有项目不一致时，会自动创建新项目。", "most_likely_failure": "混淆Langfuse的Public Key和Host，或把LangSmith项目名不匹配误报为鉴权失败。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langfuse", "cloud/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langsmith", "self-host/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langfuse", "self-host/use-dify/monitor/integrations/integrate-langsmith"]}
{"id": "dev082", "question": "无现成插件的接口如何接入，在画布怎样选操作和凭证，默认凭证在哪改？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/tools", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/tools"], "nuggets": [{"text": "可通过导入OpenAPI规范生成工具接口。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "画布中通过添加节点>工具选择具体操作。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "需认证的工具可在节点选择现有凭证或创建新凭证。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "默认凭证在集成>工具>工具插件中修改。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "parallel_compare", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/workspace/tools", "self-host/use-dify/workspace/tools"], ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/tools"]], "reference_answer": "在工作空间的工具中导入OpenAPI（Swagger）规范生成工具接口。画布点击“添加节点 > 工具”，选具体操作；需要认证时选择现有凭证或新建凭证。默认凭证在“集成 > 工具 > 工具插件”修改。", "most_likely_failure": "只建议HTTP节点而漏掉OpenAPI导入，或混淆画布凭据和工作空间默认凭据位置。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/tools", "self-host/use-dify/nodes/tools", "self-host/use-dify/workspace/tools"]}
{"id": "dev083", "question": "自建拆子域后登录失效，要改哪两个Cookie变量？换域名后401看哪个控制台跨域项，域名共享有何边界？", "split": "dev", "type": "reasoning", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "self_host", "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/deploy/quick-start/faqs", "self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/common-issues"], "nuggets": [{"text": "COOKIE_DOMAIN应设为前后端共享的顶级域名。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "NEXT_PUBLIC_COOKIE_DOMAIN应设为1以启用跨子域Cookie。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "更换域名后401可检查CONSOLE_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "Cookie不能跨不同可注册域名共享。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "parallel_compare", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/deploy/quick-start/faqs"], ["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/common-issues"]], "reference_answer": "拆分子域后可检查COOKIE_DOMAIN是否为共享顶级域名，并把NEXT_PUBLIC_COOKIE_DOMAIN设为1，然后重启。更换域名后的401可检查控制台CORS变量CONSOLE_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS。Cookie不能跨不同可注册域名共享。这些是对应故障的排查方向，不代表唯一病因。", "most_likely_failure": "混淆Cookie域与控制台CORS，或声称不同可注册域名之间也能共享Cookie。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/deploy/configuration/environments", "self-host/deploy/quick-start/faqs", "self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/common-issues"]}
{"id": "dev084", "question": "Weaviate迁移：服务端最低版本、gRPC安全连接的默认端口、Dify1.11后Worker脚本选项分别是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "self_host", "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/weaviate-v4-migration"], "nuggets": [{"text": "Weaviate v4客户端需要服务端1.27.0或更高版本。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "WEAVIATE_GRPC_ENDPOINT采用安全(TLS)连接时默认端口为443。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "Dify1.11.0及之后在Worker运行迁移脚本使用uv run --no-cache。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/weaviate-v4-migration"]], "reference_answer": "服务端至少1.27.0；gRPC端点使用安全(TLS)连接时默认端口是443（不安全为50051）。Dify1.11.0及之后在Worker执行迁移脚本使用uv run --no-cache。", "most_likely_failure": "把TLS端口说成50051，或漏掉新版Worker的无缓存选项。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/weaviate-v4-migration"]}
{"id": "dev085", "question": "Agent构建时放弃、运行时新增文件、重开对话和恢复旧版，分别怎样影响文件或构建笔记？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "self_host", "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/build/new-agent/build"], "nuggets": [{"text": "放弃构建会丢弃本轮对长期文件的改动。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "发布后的运行中新添加内容都是临时的。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "每次新对话开始时Agent都会重新读取构建笔记。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "恢复Agent版本时，沙箱长期文件也恢复到该版本。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/build/new-agent/build"]], "reference_answer": "放弃构建会丢弃本次对长期文件的改动；发布后的运行中新增内容均为临时，不会改变Agent本身。每次新对话会重新读取构建笔记；恢复旧版时，沙箱长期文件也恢复到该版本。", "most_likely_failure": "把构建阶段永久状态与发布后运行临时状态混淆。"}
{"id": "dev086", "question": "社区集成报漏洞后，官方承诺多久响应、多久发补丁？", "split": "dev", "type": "unanswerable", "unanswerable_category": "out_of_database", "edition": null, "expected_route": null, "gold_docs": [], "nuggets": [], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "refuse_correct", "behavior_subtype": "out_of_database", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [], "reference_answer": "冻结资料没有给出第三方社区集成漏洞的官方首次响应时限或补丁交付期限，无法据此报时长。这不等于官方或维护方不会处理漏洞，应查具体维护方的安全政策或支持约定。", "most_likely_failure": "把社区插件维护承诺当作Dify官方SLA，编造首次响应或补丁期限。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": []}
{"id": "dev087", "question": "教我保留事件触发器，把同一流程直接发布成MCP服务。", "split": "dev", "type": "unanswerable", "unanswerable_category": "false_premise", "edition": "self_host", "expected_route": null, "gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/start"], "nuggets": [], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "refuse_correct", "behavior_subtype": "false_premise", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/use-dify/nodes/start"]], "reference_answer": "不能按这个前提操作。只有以用户输入启动的工作流才能发布为MCP；用户输入和触发器在同一画布互斥。若要改成这种发布方式，需切换开始节点，不能保留原触发器与用户输入并存。", "most_likely_failure": "直接给出发布步骤，漏掉启动方式限制。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["self-host/use-dify/nodes/start"]}
{"id": "dev088", "question": "我用LangGraph搭RAG，给它的PostgreSQL业务库写一套Patroni跨机房故障转移配置。", "split": "dev", "type": "unanswerable", "unanswerable_category": "out_of_scope", "edition": null, "expected_route": "REFUSE", "gold_docs": [], "nuggets": [], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "refuse_correct", "behavior_subtype": "unrelated", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [], "reference_answer": "这属于LangGraph RAG服务的PostgreSQL/Patroni高可用运维，超出冻结Dify文档范围；不能据库内资料提供完整配置，应说明范围并建议查相应系统的部署资料。", "most_likely_failure": "看到RAG与PostgreSQL就误认为库内有对应运维方案，编造Patroni完整配置。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": []}
{"id": "dev089", "question": "别人导出的DSL，导入就一定兼容吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "unanswerable", "unanswerable_category": "underspecified", "edition": null, "expected_route": "CLARIFY", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/app-management", "self-host/use-dify/workspace/app-management"], "nuggets": [], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "clarify", "behavior_subtype": "version_unspecified", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/workspace/app-management"], ["self-host/use-dify/workspace/app-management"]], "reference_answer": "需要确认导入目标是Dify Cloud还是社区自部署。冻结Cloud资料说明平台始终使用最新DSL版本，导入文件兼容；自部署导入由较新Dify导出的DSL前可能需要升级。可先澄清目标部署和相对版本，也可给上述条件答案。", "most_likely_failure": "把平台持续更新与某个旧的社区实例当作相同前提。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/app-management", "self-host/use-dify/workspace/app-management"]}
{"id": "dev090", "question": "想把外部系统的资料接进来，怎么配？", "split": "dev", "type": "unanswerable", "unanswerable_category": "underspecified", "edition": null, "expected_route": "CLARIFY", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/connect-external-knowledge-base", "cloud/use-dify/workspace/api-extension/external-data-tool-api-extension"], "nuggets": [], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "clarify", "behavior_subtype": "missing_slot", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/connect-external-knowledge-base", "self-host/use-dify/knowledge/connect-external-knowledge-base"], ["cloud/use-dify/workspace/api-extension/external-data-tool-api-extension", "self-host/use-dify/workspace/api-extension/external-data-tool-api-extension"]], "reference_answer": "先确认外部系统是已有知识检索服务，还是按当前输入返回资料的业务API。前者连接外部知识库API，数据和检索逻辑仍由外部维护，Dify只有检索权限；后者用外部数据工具，把应用变量或对话输入交给API，返回字符串补进提示词。", "most_likely_failure": "未确认资料接入形态就一律走外部知识库，漏掉业务API返回字符串补入提示词的路径。", "all_equivalent_gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/connect-external-knowledge-base", "cloud/use-dify/workspace/api-extension/external-data-tool-api-extension", "self-host/use-dify/knowledge/connect-external-knowledge-base", "self-host/use-dify/workspace/api-extension/external-data-tool-api-extension"]}
